Workaround for two bugs in Effect AI 4.0.6. Remove this patch when a
release includes both fixes.

1. Tool results cannot carry images. The providers send every tool result
   that is not a string as JSON text, so the model never sees the image.
   Fix: a new `toModelContent` option on `Tool.make` and `Tool.dynamic`.
   Issue: https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/issues/9857
   Pull request: https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/pull/9860
2. When the parameters of a tool are not an object schema, the error does
   not name the tool, or the request fails at the provider.
   Fix: a clear error that names the tool and suggests `Tool.EmptyParams`.
   Pull request: https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/pull/9859

Made from the commits of both pull requests on top of the effect@4.0.6 tag.

